+#. Hades, value of the row "Active area zoom": why it does nothing
+msgctxt "#54287"
+msgid "Not used while a disc menu is shown"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
+#. Hades, value of the row "Active area zoom": why it does nothing
+msgctxt "#54288"
+msgid "Not used: the video is 3D or rotated"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
+#. Hades, value of the row "Active area zoom": why it does nothing
+msgctxt "#54289"
+msgid "Not used: the active area is under 40 % of the picture"
+msgstr ""
+
+#: xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp
+#. Hades, value of the row "Active area zoom": why it does nothing
+msgctxt "#54290"
+msgid "Not used: a measurement found picture in the bars"
